en the class Stream."}, {"step_order": 2, "step_type": "guided", "target_element": "button:Announce something to your class", "step_description": "Start a new announcement."}, {"step_order": 3, "step_type": "your_turn", "target_element": "", "step_description": "Write the announcement, choose the class and students, then post or schedule it."}]}, {"url_pattern": "classroom.google.com", "site_name": "Google Classroom", "title": "Find missing work", "summary": "Identify students who haven't submitted assignments.", "description": "Identify students who haven't submitted assignments.", "feature_name": "Work status", "estimated_required_minutes": 2, "keywords": "missing late not submitted work status students", "steps": [{"step_order": 1, "step_type": "guided", "target_element": "button:Classwork", "step_description": "Open Classwork, then choose the assignment you want to review."}, {"step_order": 2, "step_type": "your_turn", "target_element": "", "step_description": "Use the work-status list or status filter to find students marked Missing, then follow up as needed."}]}, {"url_pattern": "classroom.google.com", "site_name": "Google Classroom", "title": "Post class materials", "summary": "Upload presentations, worksheets, and documents.", "description": "Upload presentations, worksheets, and documents.", "feature_name": "Materials", "estimated_required_minutes": 2, "keywords": "upload presentations worksheets documents resource classwork", "steps": [{"step_order": 1, "step_type": "guided", "target_element": "button:Classwork", "step_description": "Open Classwork."}, {"step_order": 2, "step_type": "guided", "target_element": "button:Create", "step_description": "Choose Create to add a class resource."}, {"step_order": 3, "step_type": "your_turn", "target_element": "", "step_description": "Choose Material, add a title and attachments, optionally choose a topic, then post or schedule it."}]}, {"url_pattern": "classroom.google.com", "site_name": "Google Classroom", "title":